Section Can be added using triple hyphen ---- or horizontal line

Block Means RElated to components
      Added using tables in document
      can contain any rows and coumns
      A div for a row and and a child div for each cell generated in html
      Customize in js code to what to do with each cell
      
Metadata 2 ways to add, metadata block at document end or metadata sheet in the source root
        Metadata block takes preference if duplicate values 
        But Metadata sheet values gets merged if unique(only in sheet not in metadata)
        Sheet is available as json on preview

Section Metadata
        Add metadata block table (2 columns)at end of section (above the --- or horizontal line)
        Style key values => adds class in the section
        other than style key=> adds data-key attribute with value of 2nd column cell value

Spreadsheet and JSON Content
        Sheet is available as json on preview
        if data.xlsx sheet available in root then
        json available at https://domain.com/data.json 
        If single sheet it is default sheet (sheet name does not matters)
        If multiple sheets then name the sheets as helix-default, helix-sheet1, helix-sheet2 like this
        https://domain.com/data.json =>helix-default sheet data will be shown
        https://domain.com/data.json?sheet=sheet1 =>sheet1 data
        https://domain.com/data.json?sheet=sheet2 =>sheet2 data 

Redirects
        create sheet named redirects in source root
        2 columns source and destination
        Internal example /home  =>  /eds/home
        External example /about-us  =>  https://domain.com/anout-us
        If same url used as multiple source URLs => then last one will take effect

Custom http response headers
        Create headers named sheet in .helix folder
        3 columns rule, key,  value 
        rule is path for page can contain wildcard
        double star is wildcard
        this sheet is not available in preview/live as json file
        If multiple header matched in rule then all will be merged and applied to page

COuntry Locale
        In metadata sheet 
        url     locale      Language
        /en/**  en          English
        /fr/**  fr          French

        <meta name="locale" content ="en">               
        <meta name="locale" content ="fr">               

Placeholders (Related to i18n)
        Create sheet named placeholders in site roots ex, /en/placeholders and /fr/placeholders
        2 columns Key and Text

Sidekick Customization
        we can add custom actions or action container
        add plugins in this file
        /tools/sidekick/config.json

AEM Asset integration
        We can add a plugin so than on google docs document while authoring we can select aem assets (image) and copy paste in to our document.
        We can filter, choose folders of aem assets


Sidekick library
        Documentation for blocks , desktop/mobile views, componentn variations supported

Indexing
        create spreadsheet named query-index in .helix folder of source
        create sheet raw_index
        columns page path is mandatory, and  multiple columns possible
        all clumns must be present in meta tags of page




